r\n./core/string/ustring.h:626:9: note:   candidate expects 1 argument, 2 provided\r\n./core/string/ustring.h:623:9: note: candidate: 'String::String(const char*)'\r\n  623 |         String(const char *p_cstr) {\r\n      |         ^~~~~~\r\n./core/string/ustring.h:623:9: note:   candidate expects 1 argument, 2 provided\r\n./core/string/ustring.h:608:24: note: candidate: 'String::String(String&&)'\r\n  608 |         _FORCE_INLINE_ String(String &&p_str) :\r\n      |                        ^~~~~~\r\n./core/string/ustring.h:608:24: note:   candidate expects 1 argument, 2 provided\r\n./core/string/ustring.h:607:24: note: candidate: 'String::String(const String&)'\r\n  607 |         _FORCE_INLINE_ String(const String &p_str) { _cowdata._ref(p_str._cowdata); }\r\n      |                        ^~~~~~\r\n./core/string/ustring.h:607:24: note:   candidate expects 1 argument, 2 provided\r\n./core/string/ustring.h:606:24: note: candidate: 'String::String()'\r\n  606 |         _FORCE_INLINE_ String() {}\r\n      |                        ^~~~~~\r\n./core/string/ustring.h:606:24: note:   candidate expects 0 arguments, 2 provided\r\nscons: *** [bin/obj/scene/resources/scu/scu_scene_resources.gen.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.o] Error 1\r\nscons: building terminated because of errors.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2741992388/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2743232361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99504#issuecomment-2743232361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99504","id":2743232361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jgmdp","user":{"login":"LunaCapra","id":50772474,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzcyNDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50772474?v